WEBVTT

00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,680
Anyone who is looking for the cause of their cancer I think Dr. Connors is

00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:08,880
incredible and I'm blessed to have him in my life.

00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:12,240
I'm grateful because this has been such an

00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:15,520
is such a positive experience for my wife and I.

00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:18,000
He said, I'm not the healer, God is the healer,

00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,760
God is sovereign, I am not, and I almost fall off my chair.

00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:25,520
And then he continued to say, it's God that gets the glory through this no matter

00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:27,680
how what the outcome is if you allow them.

00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:30,560
And that was exactly what Eric had been saying.

00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:35,520
So when we walked out we were like, we know this is where the Lord is directing us

00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:37,520
for this protocol.

